-- ---- s 448A(1): the exemption itself (lines 6084-6087) ----
-- The arguments: subsidiary undertaking; dormant throughout; parent established in the UK; the (2) answer; the s 448B answer.
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` FALSE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Section 448B cannot say a company is outside the exclusion (its list is not shown to be closed): not covered where (2) is met.
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 448A(1) the directors of the dormant subsidiary are not required to deliver a copy of the individual accounts` TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- The regulative rule for (2)(e): the directors deliver by day 273 (FULFILLED) or later (BREACH BY Director).
#TRACE `s 448A(2)(e) the directors' duty to deliver the documents` 273 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Registrar, "deliver a written notice of the agreement, the statement under section 448C(1), a copy of the consolidated accounts, a copy of the auditor's report on them and a copy of the consolidated annual report" AT 200
#TRACE `s 448A(2)(e) the directors' duty to deliver the documents` 273 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Registrar, "deliver a written notice of the agreement, the statement under section 448C(1), a copy of the consolidated accounts, a copy of the auditor's report on them and a copy of the consolidated annual report" AT 300
